---
// Slim announcement banner between Hero and About
---

<section class="bg-[#f3ecf8] border-y border-[#e0cff0]">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 text-center">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#a180be] mb-2">Now Recruiting</p>
    <h2 class="font-['Open_Sauce_Sans'] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#3d2466] mb-3">
      GirlCon CORE + National team applications are open!
    </h2>
    <p class="text-[#7c6f8a] max-w-lg mx-auto mb-2">
      If you are currently in high school, follow this link to apply for the GirlCon <strong class="text-[#6b4fa0]">Core</strong> or <strong class="text-[#6b4fa0]">National</strong> teams and help us plan next year's conference.
    </p>
    <p class="text-[#7c6f8a] max-w-lg mx-auto mb-5">
      Applications close <strong class="text-[#6b4fa0]">Sunday, October 18th at 11:59PM CST</strong>.
    </p>
    <a
      href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe0PUxGsrwE-acigDNDfO1N6g-EMox4biXsBB7yq6wxVPm97Q/viewform?usp=header"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#a180be] text-white font-medium hover:bg-[#6b4fa0] transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-purple-300/30"
    >
      Apply Now
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
